  "description": "ORUZEJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H84 Eu4 N12 O22. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.620-3.896 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.88-111.75°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C104H84N12O22Eu4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
